{"track":"r","category":"오류 처리·환경","level":3,"title":"클로저: 곱하기 함수 공장","desc":"<p><code>make_multiplier(n)</code>을 만드세요. 호출하면 \"받은 수에 <code>n</code>을 곱해 주는 함수\"를 돌려줘요. 예: <code>double <- make_multiplier(2); double(5)</code> → 10</p>","starter":"make_multiplier <- function(n) {\n  \n}\n","solution":"make_multiplier <- function(n) {\n  function(x) x * n\n}\n","hint":"<p>함수 안에서 <code>function(x) ...</code>를 그대로 돌려주면 돼요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"make_multiplier(2)(5)","expected":10,"visible":true},{"call":"make_multiplier(10)(0.5)","expected":5,"visible":true},{"call":"{ f <- make_multiplier(3); f(f(2)) }","expected":18,"visible":false},{"call":"make_multiplier(0)(99)","expected":0,"visible":false}],"id":"r-518"}